---
title: Aviation
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 35 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @gin{2%fl_oz}, @maraschino liqueur{0.5%fl_oz}, @crème de violette{0.25%fl_oz} and @lemon juice{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a @cocktail cherry{1}.

> Go easy on the violette: too much and it tastes of soap.
